# AI-hint: One action for the MiOS-Xbox VM: setup-looking-glass.py --launch starts the first defined domain of mios.toml [vm.looking_glass].domains (virsh start when it is not running), waits for the IVSHMEM framebuffer and execs looking-glass-client with the SSOT SPICE host/port/audio and shmFile.
# AI-related: /usr/libexec/mios/vfio/setup-looking-glass.py, mios.toml [vm.looking_glass], [desktop.hyprland].window_rules mios-looking-glass
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=MiOS-Xbox
GenericName=Windows Gaming VM
Comment=Start the MiOS-Xbox VM and show it in Looking Glass
Exec=/usr/libexec/mios/vfio/setup-looking-glass.py --launch
Icon=input-gaming
Categories=System;Emulator;Game;
Keywords=xbox;windows;vm;looking;glass;gaming;kvm;vfio;
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=false
StartupWMClass=looking-glass-client
